  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Get the URL that the SOVD client shall use to request a token. The SOVD client will be redirected to that URL. If OAuth 2.0 is used, this would be the URL to look up the Authorization Server’s token endpoint.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
